    "legend": "Chromosomal microarray. Typical copy-number profile, demonstrating copy-neutral loss of heterozygosity of chromosome&nbsp;9 with homozygous deletion of <em>CDKN2A</em> and/or <em>CDKN2B</em>. Additional whole-chromosome gains were present, including gains of chromosomes&nbsp;4, 14, and 21 (three copies) and chromosome&nbsp;7 (four copies).",
