    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for pleomorphic xanthoastrocytoma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Laura Peferoen - copied from text into table",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 14.25pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"567\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 14.25pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"567\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">An astrocytoma with pleomorphic tumour cells, including large multinucleated cells, spindle cells, xanthomatous (lipidized) cells, and eosinophilic granular bodies</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 16.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 16.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"567\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 16.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 16.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"567\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Reticulin deposition</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 16.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 16.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"567\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">BRAF</span></em><span style=\" \"> mutation or other MAPK pathway gene alterations, combined with homozygous deletion of </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">CDKN2A</span></em><span style=\" \"> and/or </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">CDKN2B</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 16.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 16.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"567\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">A DNA methylome profile of pleomorphic xanthoastrocytoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
